sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User / Settings UI
  participant Store as Vue Reactive Store
  participant Server as Embedded Backend (server.ts)
  participant Auth as AuthService (auth-service.ts)
  participant Crypto as Crypto Module (crypto.ts)
  participant SafeStorage as Electron safeStorage (OS DPAPI/Keychain)
  participant DB as SQLite user_secrets_vault
  participant Provider as Remote AI Provider (Gemini / OpenAI / Anthropic)

  Note over User,Store: Phase 1: Key Storage & Protection
  User->>Store: Enter API key (e.g. AIzaSy...)
  Store->>Server: POST /api/v1/providers/keys { provider, apiKey }
  Server->>Auth: saveSecret(userId, provider, apiKey)
  Auth->>Crypto: encryptSecret(plaintextKey)
  Crypto->>SafeStorage: Retrieve / Decrypt random master key from kms-master.enc
  SafeStorage-->>Crypto: Decrypted 256-bit Master Key Buffer
  Crypto->>Crypto: AES-256-GCM encrypt (random 12-byte nonce)
  Crypto-->>Auth: { ciphertext, nonce, tag, keyHint: "...1234" }
  Auth->>DB: UPSERT user_secrets_vault (ciphertext, nonce, tag, keyHint)
  Auth-->>Server: Return { provider, keyHint }
  Server-->>Store: 200 OK { provider, keyHint } (Full key NEVER returned to UI)
  Store-->>User: Display masked key hint "...1234"

  Note over Server,Provider: Phase 2: Trusted Retrieval & Execution
  Server->>Auth: getDecryptedSecret(userId, provider)
  Auth->>DB: SELECT ciphertext, nonce, tag WHERE userId AND provider
  DB-->>Auth: { ciphertext, nonce, tag }
  Auth->>Crypto: decryptSecret(ciphertext, nonce, tag)
  Crypto->>SafeStorage: Decrypt 256-bit Master Key
  SafeStorage-->>Crypto: Master Key Buffer
  Crypto->>Crypto: AES-256-GCM decrypt with auth tag verification
  Crypto-->>Auth: Plaintext API Key
  Auth-->>Server: Plaintext API Key in ephemeral memory
  Server->>Provider: HTTPS POST (Secret in HTTP Header ONLY: x-goog-api-key / Bearer)
  Provider-->>Server: 200 OK Model Response
  Note over Server: Plaintext key immediately dereferenced from memory
